No, because the chains haven't appeared yet,

00:23:37.100 --> 00:23:39.692
so there must be chains first, right? It's

00:23:41.280 --> 00:23:42.455
okay.

00:23:43.780 --> 00:23:44.913
The next verse,

00:23:46.797 --> 00:23:48.847
RE ZHIG BCINGS PA

00:23:51.172 --> 00:23:52.472
MI GROL TE,

00:23:52.472 --> 00:23:55.778
MA BCINGS PA YANG GROL MI ‘GYUR,

