RE ZHIG means temporary,

00:24:07.230 --> 00:24:10.818
currently.

00:24:10.818 --> 00:24:12.709
RE ZHIG - now

00:24:12.709 --> 00:24:14.460
BCINGS PA MI GROL TE

00:24:14.460 --> 00:24:18.333
right now, you can't untie the chains.

00:24:19.408 --> 00:24:23.160
Let's see, it's a bit like saying,

00:24:23.160 --> 00:24:26.393
you see, you can't untie your chains.  Why?

00:24:28.280 --> 00:24:30.113
First of all,

00:24:30.113 --> 00:24:33.530
Nagarjuna said,
First of all, you cannot untie your chains.

00:24:33.530 --> 00:24:35.855
You cannot loosen these chains.

00:24:42.610 --> 00:24:45.271
You have to argue with your husband.

00:24:48.360 --> 00:24:53.130
You cannot untie these chains.  Why?

00:24:53.130 --> 00:24:55.580
Because you see the chains,

00:24:56.589 --> 00:24:59.950
you cannot remove them.  Why?

00:24:59.950 --> 00:25:04.660
Because you think those chains come from it,

00:25:04.660 --> 00:25:09.013
and the way you think about chains
is itself a chain,

00:25:10.220 --> 00:25:11.490
understand?

00:25:11.490 --> 00:25:14.690
He said, "Let me tell you

00:25:14.690 --> 00:25:15.523
what

00:25:15.523 --> 00:25:18.010
you can't untie these chains.

00:25:18.010 --> 00:25:18.843
Why?"

00:25:18.843 --> 00:25:22.810
Because the chain comes from this direction.

00:25:22.810 --> 00:25:27.440
To think that the chain comes from its own direction is the chain itself.

00:25:27.440 --> 00:25:29.640
That's sexy.

00:25:29.640 --> 00:25:31.620
To think that the chain comes from its own direction.

00:25:31.620 --> 00:25:34.430
When you look at the chain like this, that's the real chain.

00:25:34.430 --> 00:25:35.670
If you look at the chain like this,

00:25:35.670 --> 00:25:38.610
then you will be entangled tighter and tighter. Do

00:25:38.610 --> 00:25:41.090
you understand?

00:25:41.090 --> 00:25:42.567
Very sexy

00:25:42.567 --> 00:25:44.590
MA BCINGS PA YANG GROL MI ‘GYUR

00:25:44.590 --> 00:25:45.990
Even if I remove the chains from you,

00:25:45.990 --> 00:25:48.273
you are still bound [laughs]

00:25:49.986 --> 00:25:52.758
Understand?

00:25:52.758 --> 00:25:55.449
BCINGS PA GROL BZHIN YIN ‘GYUR NA

00:25:55.449 --> 00:25:57.949
BCINGS DANG GROL BA DUS GCIG ‘GYUR

00:25:57.949 --> 00:26:00.490
If there is a midpoint on the path your foot is on, a

00:26:03.100 --> 00:26:06.183
point between being bound and unbound,

00:26:07.650 --> 00:26:12.120
then there must be a point between the part of the path you have already walked

00:26:12.120 --> 00:26:14.670
and the part of the path you are about to step on.

00:26:14.670 --> 00:26:19.330


00:26:19.330 --> 00:26:20.840
If there is a point that can be touched between binding and unbinding, then

00:26:20.840 --> 00:26:23.410


00:26:23.410 --> 00:26:26.460
at the same instant, you can be both bound and
unbound.

00:26:26.460 --> 00:26:29.100
This is impossible. It's

00:26:29.100 --> 00:26:32.929
like seeing Nagarjuna.

00:26:32.929 --> 00:26:35.385
We can dance, right?

00:26:36.400 --> 00:26:38.910
Some kind of Hawaiian dance.

00:26:42.440 --> 00:26:43.918
Okay, next verse:

00:26:47.767 --> 00:26:49.775
BDAG NI LEN MED MYA NGAN ‘DA’

00:26:49.775 --> 00:26:52.675
MYANG ‘DAS BDAG GIR ‘GYUR RO ZHES.

