00:28:14.473 --> 00:28:16.440
Who am I?  Who am I?

00:28:16.440 --> 00:28:17.959
What is Nirvana?

00:28:17.959 --> 00:28:20.730
BDAG GIR ZHES means "

00:28:20.730 --> 00:28:23.110
I want it to be mine.

00:28:23.110 --> 00:28:28.110
" Christina, the

00:28:29.632 --> 00:28:31.898
