00:28:59.403 --> 00:29:01.140
I want to have Nirvana.

00:29:01.140 --> 00:29:04.400
Oh, that self-existing "I."

00:29:04.400 --> 00:29:06.206
Cool, understand?

00:29:06.206 --> 00:29:07.039
Self.

00:29:07.039 --> 00:29:09.170
I want the self to have Nirvana,

00:29:09.170 --> 00:29:10.320
but the self doesn't exist

00:29:10.320 --> 00:29:12.760
because "self" means self-nature,

00:29:12.760 --> 00:29:15.426
okay?  DE LTAR GANG DAG ‘DZIN DE YI

00:29:15.426 --> 00:29:18.480
NYER LEN ‘DZIN PA CHEN PO YIN
NYER LEN ‘DZIN PA CHEN PO YIN

00:29:18.480 --> 00:29:22.120
You yearn for Nirvana.

