This is just a more serious misunderstanding.

00:29:26.860 --> 00:29:27.693
Wow,

00:29:29.600 --> 00:29:33.770
you yearn for "Nirvana."

00:29:33.770 --> 00:29:37.199
This is the first branch of the wheel of life,

00:29:37.199 --> 00:29:39.260
okay?

00:29:39.260 --> 00:29:40.550
I want to escape the cycle of life.

00:29:40.550 --> 00:29:42.030
Okay, how do I do that?

00:29:42.030 --> 00:29:43.560
I'm going to create my own Nirvana. It's

00:29:43.560 --> 00:29:46.201
so cool. This is the first branch of the Wheel of Life.

00:29:46.201 --> 00:29:48.925
[laughs] Got it?

00:29:48.925 --> 00:29:51.122
You should be laughing. What's
wrong with you all? Let

00:29:51.122 --> 00:29:53.040
me say it again:

00:29:53.040 --> 00:29:54.420
I want to escape the cycle of life.

00:29:54.420 --> 00:29:56.260
Really?  So what are you going to do?

00:29:56.260 --> 00:29:58.390
I want to create my own Nirvana.

00:29:58.390 --> 00:30:00.180
This is the first branch of the wheel of life.

00:30:00.180 --> 00:30:02.387
Very good, very good. [laughs]

00:30:02.387 --> 00:30:03.400
Understand?

00:30:03.400 --> 00:30:05.308
This is interesting.

00:30:07.431 --> 00:30:11.572
GANG LA MYA NGAN 'DAS BSKYED MED

00:30:11.572 --> 00:30:14.947
'KHOR BA BSAL BA'ANG YOD MIN PA

00:30:18.150 --> 00:30:21.730
This part is difficult,
therefore you need Master Qiuni.

00:30:21.730 --> 00:30:24.305
This line means that

00:30:26.222 --> 00:30:29.940
you cannot create Nirvana anywhere.

00:30:29.940 --> 00:30:34.080
No matter where you are, you cannot BSKYED.
BSKYED has a D,

00:30:34.080 --> 00:30:36.620
which means "to create,"
not "to be born."

00:30:36.620 --> 00:30:40.820
Without the letter D, it means birth.
With the letter D, it means creation. What

00:30:40.820 --> 00:30:44.960
is the most common use of this verb?

00:30:44.960 --> 00:30:46.460
Very close.

00:30:46.460 --> 00:30:47.830
Correct.

00:30:47.830 --> 00:30:49.697
So, what about SEMS BSKYED?

00:30:50.922 --> 00:30:52.010
Arouse consciousness.

00:30:52.010 --> 00:30:54.690
Arouse the desire to attain enlightenment.

00:30:54.690 --> 00:30:59.100
Okay, the $100 question. My

00:30:59.100 --> 00:31:01.760
God, you've made a lot of money today.

00:31:04.810 --> 00:31:07.677
Master Qiuni said, the word BSKYED

00:31:07.677 --> 00:31:09.700
here means creation.

00:31:09.700 --> 00:31:11.830
"You want to create your Nirvana, right?"

00:31:11.830 --> 00:31:16.690
You want to create your Nirvana.

00:31:16.690 --> 00:31:20.010
He said the word "creation" is
a code word. It's a

00:31:20.010 --> 00:31:21.500
pronoun for SGRO 'DOGS.

00:31:21.500 --> 00:31:26.079
In the pair of words SGRO 'DOGS and SKUR 'DEBS,

00:31:26.079 --> 00:31:27.817
[Jime]

00:31:27.817 --> 00:31:29.180
is overestimated. Yes, $100.

00:31:29.180 --> 00:31:31.480
Jimei, can you pay Jimei $100?

00:31:31.480 --> 00:31:33.400
Now, which company received the money,

00:31:33.400 --> 00:31:35.668
and which company gave it out?

00:31:35.668 --> 00:31:38.388
And where is the line between these two?

00:31:38.388 --> 00:31:41.890
Yes, overestimated.

00:31:41.890 --> 00:31:43.716
So what does it mean here?

00:31:44.750 --> 00:31:47.520
When you say, "I want to have Nirvana,"

00:31:47.520 --> 00:31:51.343
you are creating a false Nirvana.

00:31:52.610 --> 00:31:55.070
You are creating a self-existent Nirvana.

00:31:55.070 --> 00:31:58.640
When you say, "I want to have Nirvana,"

00:31:58.640 --> 00:32:03.210
you are creating Nirvana.
But Master Chögyam Trung said that

00:32:03.210 --> 00:32:05.440
Nagarjuna used the word "create" here.

00:32:05.440 --> 00:32:08.523
He was referring to a self-existent Nirvana, understand?

00:32:09.720 --> 00:32:13.597
Okay, 'KHOR BA BSAL BA'ANG YOD MIN PA

00:32:16.124 --> 00:32:17.512
'KHOR BA BSAL BA means

00:32:17.512 --> 00:32:21.904
you can't even remove that Nirvana. The previous meaning of

00:32:21.904 --> 00:32:23.480
BSAL BA here

00:32:23.480 --> 00:32:25.490
is "ajate".

00:32:25.490 --> 00:32:27.112
$100 problem

00:32:27.112 --> 00:32:28.407
[Lady] drive.

00:32:28.407 --> 00:32:30.563
Oh dear, $100!

00:32:31.430 --> 00:32:32.660


00:32:32.660 --> 00:32:34.920
Before "drive," the word BSAL BA

00:32:34.920 --> 00:32:39.340
means "drive," right? It
refers to the existence of things.

00:32:39.340 --> 00:32:42.860
BSAL BA here means to remove,
like clear light.

00:32:43.750 --> 00:32:45.223


00:32:46.540 --> 00:32:50.540
If you try to make Nirvana yours,
this is Nirvana of self-existence.

00:32:50.540 --> 00:32:54.560
This is also Nirvana, it's the same.

00:32:54.560 --> 00:32:56.772
But this can never be true Nirvana.

00:32:56.772 --> 00:33:00.532
DE LA 'KHOR BA CI ZHIG YIN

00:33:00.532 --> 00:33:03.000
So what do you think Nirvana is?

00:33:03.000 --> 00:33:04.963
What do you think Nirvana is?

00:33:05.910 --> 00:33:07.823
Who is asking?

00:33:07.823 --> 00:33:09.470
CI ZHIG:

00:33:09.470 --> 00:33:14.470
Sorry, you people who want to create Nirvana,

00:33:15.330 --> 00:33:17.063
what do you think reincarnation is?

00:33:17.063 --> 00:33:18.492
What do you think?

00:33:18.492 --> 00:33:19.580
What do you think reincarnation is?

00:33:19.580 --> 00:33:22.980
Now, do you want to know some frustrating things?  The

00:33:22.980 --> 00:33:25.473
answer wasn't found in either of the engraved copies.

00:33:25.473 --> 00:33:28.280
[Student laughs] It's unbelievable that

00:33:28.280 --> 00:33:31.030
the answer wasn't found in either of the engraved copies.

00:33:31.030 --> 00:33:33.160


00:33:33.160 --> 00:33:37.583
No one has discovered it in 370 years.

00:33:40.180 --> 00:33:41.550
I don't know what's going on. I do

00:33:41.550 --> 00:33:44.318
n't know what those people in the monastery are doing.

00:33:45.170 --> 00:33:50.170
But the answer is in the commentaries, in Nagarjuna's copy.

00:33:50.840 --> 00:33:55.840
There's this line in Nagarjuna's engraved copy

00:33:55.970 --> 00:33:57.480
because he was quoting these verses.

00:33:57.480 --> 00:33:59.390
So I went there and found it. Thanks to the

00:33:59.390 --> 00:34:02.790
German-Austrian Club,

00:34:02.790 --> 00:34:06.900
I was able to go to India and find it there.

00:34:06.900 --> 00:34:08.717
I found it in India.

00:34:08.717 --> 00:34:11.850
That line was indeed missing, the whole line was missing. The

00:34:11.850 --> 00:34:13.320
answer to that question:

00:34:13.320 --> 00:34:16.190
What do you think samsara is? The

00:34:16.190 --> 00:34:18.550
previous answer is missing.

00:34:18.550 --> 00:34:20.020
So, here is the answer:

00:34:20.020 --> 00:34:22.973
MYA NGAN 'DAS PA'ANG CI ZHIG BRTAG. The

00:34:28.788 --> 00:34:31.160
BRTAG here

00:34:31.160 --> 00:34:33.118
is yes.

00:34:33.118 --> 00:34:34.930
MYA NGAN 'DAS PA'ANG CI ZHIG BRTAG.

00:34:34.930 --> 00:34:38.360
When

00:34:38.360 --> 00:34:41.963
you're thinking about what samsara is, what comes to mind?

00:34:42.979 --> 00:34:44.610
CI ZHIG BRTAG.

00:34:44.610 --> 00:34:47.670
What came to mind when I asked the question?

00:34:47.670 --> 00:34:49.870
We were just talking about nirvana, right?  That

00:34:49.870 --> 00:34:51.710
is, to be freed from the cycle of reincarnation.

00:34:51.710 --> 00:34:53.930
But when I ask you what reincarnation is,

00:34:53.930 --> 00:34:56.530
you start to wander around here.

00:34:56.530 --> 00:35:00.486
A stupid question.

00:35:01.600 --> 00:35:04.520
You've gone in the wrong direction in the exam, understand?

00:35:04.520 --> 00:35:09.520
You asked a stupid question. A

00:35:09.930 --> 00:35:12.570
stupid question [laughs].

00:35:12.570 --> 00:35:14.327
You asked a stupid question. Do

00:35:15.439 --> 00:35:17.030
you understand?

00:35:17.030 --> 00:35:18.300
This is the missing line.

00:35:18.300 --> 00:35:21.958
Perhaps it's impolite to say it like this,
so he didn't leave that line.

00:35:24.690 --> 00:35:27.180
Let's look at this picture.

00:35:27.180 --> 00:35:30.196
Can you explain what this picture means?

00:35:31.830 --> 00:35:34.250
It's a roulette wheel.

00:35:34.250 --> 00:35:36.190
What does that mean?

00:35:36.190 --> 00:35:38.300
While you were pursuing Nirvana,

00:35:40.910 --> 00:35:44.038
[student's answer] while

00:35:44.038 --> 00:35:47.253
you were pursuing Nirvana, what were you doing?

00:35:51.119 --> 00:35:55.286
[Student's answer]

00:35:57.610 --> 00:36:00.390
You've turned the wheel of reincarnation again. [Laughter]

00:36:00.390 --> 00:36:03.873
Your pursuit of Nirvana has turned the cycle of rebirth again.

00:36:04.960 --> 00:36:07.527
Great, very true. [Laughter]

00:36:08.490 --> 00:36:13.490
In my view, your pursuit of Nirvana has
turned the cycle of rebirth again.

00:36:13.740 --> 00:36:15.560
Congratulations!

00:36:15.560 --> 00:36:20.200
Your pursuit of Nirvana has
turned the cycle of rebirth again.

00:36:20.200 --> 00:36:21.670
That's what it means.

00:36:21.670 --> 00:36:24.130
And I'm not trying to scare you,

00:36:24.130 --> 00:36:28.360
but reciting the Medicine Buddha mantra in the wrong way

00:36:28.360 --> 00:36:31.720
will make you sick and

00:36:31.720 --> 00:36:35.163
prolong your physical suffering.

00:36:36.140 --> 00:36:37.940
I'm not saying that reciting the Medicine Buddha mantra will give you cancer. That's

00:36:37.940 --> 00:36:39.635
not what

00:36:39.635 --> 00:36:43.790
I mean. What I mean is that doing it with misunderstanding

00:36:45.208 --> 00:36:50.208
will prolong the illness and

00:36:51.300 --> 00:36:55.410
continue the cycle of rebirth instead of stopping it.

00:36:55.410 --> 00:36:58.500
This is very heavy, very heavy.

00:36:58.500 --> 00:37:03.330
We must understand that for the mantra to be truly effective,

00:37:03.330 --> 00:37:07.350
we must first protect our lives.
Otherwise, the mantra will not work,

00:37:07.350 --> 00:37:09.950
and you may even die during the recitation. Do you understand?

00:37:15.318 --> 00:37:19.660
Okay, now is a good time. The
time for sadness is over.

00:37:19.660 --> 00:37:21.670
Any questions?

00:37:21.670 --> 00:37:24.748
[Jimei] Does this mean it's

00:37:24.748 --> 00:37:29.088
better not to chant any spells?  That's a

00:37:29.088 --> 00:37:31.005
very good question,

00:37:32.350 --> 00:37:34.090
Geshe-la. Does this mean that

00:37:34.090 --> 00:37:37.610
if I don't understand emptiness, I should stop chanting mantras?

00:37:37.610 --> 00:37:39.320
No, you must continue chanting mantras.

00:37:39.320 --> 00:37:40.210
Why?

00:37:40.210 --> 00:37:42.610
Because when you chant mantras, you

00:37:44.337 --> 00:37:48.360
generally have a good intention as a foundation,

00:37:48.360 --> 00:37:50.760
and this foundation of good intention

00:37:50.760 --> 00:37:54.570
will help you understand emptiness later.

00:37:54.570 --> 00:37:58.160
So if you don't understand how mantras work,

00:37:58.160 --> 00:38:00.240
please persist in chanting, because it can help you

00:38:00.240 --> 00:38:01.610
understand how mantras work.

00:38:01.610 --> 00:38:05.990
But don't procrastinate in the process of understanding how mantras work,


00:38:05.990 --> 00:38:07.730
because you might die first.

00:38:07.730 --> 00:38:10.480
Really, seriously, I'm not joking.

00:38:10.480 --> 00:38:13.630
But whenever you chant mantras, it's a good seed.

00:38:13.630 --> 00:38:15.730
If you don't work on emptiness at the same time,

00:38:15.730 --> 00:38:19.220
perhaps the seed will help you in the next life.

00:38:19.220 --> 00:38:21.120
You can chant mantras for half an hour,

00:38:21.120 --> 00:38:23.110
then read Nagarjuna's teachings for 10 minutes,

00:38:23.110 --> 00:38:25.170
and then go back to chant mantras for half an hour.

00:38:25.170 --> 00:38:26.970
This is a good balance.

00:38:26.970 --> 00:38:29.710
But don't ignore Nagarjuna's teachings

00:38:29.710 --> 00:38:32.535
and say, "I'll sit down and chant mantras all day long."

00:38:33.410 --> 00:38:35.140
Because it's very possible that you'll die

00:38:35.140 --> 00:38:38.500
before you receive the benefits of the mantra

00:38:38.500 --> 00:38:40.030
or before you help anyone.

00:38:40.030 --> 00:38:45.030
So keep sprinkling Nagarjuna's teachings on you.

00:38:45.840 --> 00:38:47.450
Don't say, "This is difficult for me,"

00:38:47.450 --> 00:38:50.597
because samsara will make it even harder for you. You have to find a way.

00:38:51.459 --> 00:38:54.243
Okay, let's learn some Sanskrit.

00:38:54.243 --> 00:38:59.150
Let's talk about samsara. Sansara, did

00:38:59.150 --> 00:39:00.150
everyone notice?

00:39:00.150 --> 00:39:03.450
Yes, the pronunciation is saṃsāra.

00:39:03.450 --> 00:39:05.590
What is the symbol below it?

00:39:05.590 --> 00:39:10.590
Please don't pronounce it as saṃsāra. The

00:39:10.940 --> 00:39:15.940
misunderstanding arises because there's a dot below the letter M. Adding an

00:39:16.730 --> 00:39:21.063
extra dot below the letter M means it's not pronounced as M.

00:39:22.980 --> 00:39:26.310
They just didn't have any other letters available. I'm

00:39:26.310 --> 00:39:27.750
sorry.

00:39:27.750 --> 00:39:32.750
So please, this isn't M, it's an
M with a dot below. An

00:39:33.440 --> 00:39:37.030
M with a dot below, like those French people

00:39:37.030 --> 00:39:40.240
... like…@ (other languages)

00:39:40.240 --> 00:39:42.930
because they often speak like that.

00:39:42.930 --> 00:39:45.090
Geshe teacher, you must come to Paris!

00:39:45.090 --> 00:39:49.390
You'll have the best… It has a nasal tone.

00:39:49.390 --> 00:39:52.762
So the M with a dot below is pronounced

00:39:52.762 --> 00:39:55.563
Sansara, sansara, not saMsara.

00:39:56.490 --> 00:40:00.400
This happened, I don't know. The
British made this mistake,

00:40:00.400 --> 00:40:02.080
and then it just kept going wrong.

00:40:02.080 --> 00:40:04.912
Everyone started saying samsara, samsara,

00:40:04.912 --> 00:40:06.550
kind of like names.

00:40:06.550 --> 00:40:09.163
Hey, my friends Sam and Sara.

00:40:12.030 --> 00:40:13.950
And this really annoys me. By

00:40:13.950 --> 00:40:18.150
the way, recently someone posted a video

00:40:18.150 --> 00:40:21.980
with my photo in it, and all the Sanskrit in it was misspelled.

00:40:21.980 --> 00:40:23.630
Please don't do this. It

00:40:23.630 --> 00:40:25.890
drives me crazy.

00:40:25.890 --> 00:40:28.940
If you're going to use my name and photo,

00:40:28.940 --> 00:40:32.040
please let me see it first.

00:40:32.040 --> 00:40:35.300
Some people also used Western Chinese languages ​​and misspelled everything.

00:40:35.300 --> 00:40:37.320


00:40:37.320 --> 00:40:40.720
So please everyone…

00:40:40.720 --> 00:40:43.990
You might see that I'm very enthusiastic about these things, but

00:40:45.134 --> 00:40:48.960
Sri Lanka is also misspelled. The

00:40:48.960 --> 00:40:52.010
Sivananda Yoga Center is misspelled

00:40:52.010 --> 00:40:55.602
because they omitted the diacritics.

00:40:55.602 --> 00:40:58.470
They omitted the phonetic symbols,

00:40:58.470 --> 00:41:01.400
just like omitting the dot under the letter M.

00:41:01.400 --> 00:41:03.440
So poor Mr. Sivananda,

00:41:03.440 --> 00:41:06.840
his name will be mispronounced forever,

00:41:06.840 --> 00:41:11.050
and so will the poor country's name. It

00:41:11.050 --> 00:41:15.516
's Shri Lanka, not Sri Lanka.

00:41:15.516 --> 00:41:17.473
That dot was omitted. Do you

00:41:18.420 --> 00:41:19.253
understand?

00:41:19.253 --> 00:41:22.443
Like samsara,

00:41:23.277 --> 00:41:26.123
okay, Geshe teacher.
If you want to provoke Geshe teacher,

00:41:26.990 --> 00:41:28.210
now you know what to do.

00:41:28.210 --> 00:41:31.450
"Sam" means "together," "with,"

00:41:31.450 --> 00:41:34.029
which is itself "sam."

00:41:34.029 --> 00:41:39.029
Then √sṛ means flowing,
and Europeans also use √ser.

00:41:40.320 --> 00:41:45.320
This can be seen in the word "serum,"
meaning flowing things.

00:41:45.790 --> 00:41:50.580
The word "pie" is also interesting, coming from √ser

00:41:50.580 --> 00:41:55.580
because it's the swirling appearance of a delicious cinnamon roll.

00:41:56.550 --> 00:41:59.450
This

00:41:59.450 --> 00:42:02.663
is very descriptive in the Sanskrit word sansara. The

00:42:03.540 --> 00:42:06.453
connection between pie and samsara is inseparable.

00:42:07.570 --> 00:42:09.590
If you have a pie, give it to me, and

00:42:09.590 --> 00:42:12.162
I'll handle it.

00:42:12.162 --> 00:42:14.323
That's samsara, the same root. That

00:42:18.140 --> 00:42:21.710
concludes this section. Let's review.

00:42:21.710 --> 00:42:24.950
We tried to find out

00:42:24.950 --> 00:42:27.100
who wants to reach Nirvana

00:42:27.100 --> 00:42:30.820
and who is bound in their own body and consciousness.

00:42:30.820 --> 00:42:33.390
You should think about this.

00:42:33.390 --> 00:42:36.660
Everyone says, "I want to reach Nirvana." Everyone

00:42:36.660 --> 00:42:39.630
says, "I want to escape the wheel of life."

00:42:39.630 --> 00:42:42.650
Have you noticed the house in the wheel of life?  Did

00:42:42.650 --> 00:42:44.573
you notice the two people on the boat in the Wheel of Life

00:42:44.573 --> 00:42:45.552
?  Who are the

00:42:45.552 --> 00:42:49.141
two people on the boat in the Wheel of Life?

00:42:49.141 --> 00:42:50.179
[Student's answer]

00:42:50.179 --> 00:42:52.442
MING GZUGS

00:42:52.442 --> 00:42:55.090
[Student's answer]

00:42:55.090 --> 00:42:57.903
Yes, body and consciousness.

00:42:59.050 --> 00:43:00.890
When you escape reincarnation,

00:43:00.890 --> 00:43:04.190
you have to discard that ship,

00:43:04.190 --> 00:43:05.800
along with the body and consciousness inside.

00:43:05.800 --> 00:43:08.720
So what's left?  [Laughter]

00:43:08.720 --> 00:43:11.010
Would you walk around without a body or consciousness?

00:43:11.010 --> 00:43:12.400
Come on, let me introduce my friend.

00:43:12.400 --> 00:43:13.233
I can't see him. Yes,

00:43:13.233 --> 00:43:15.530
sorry, he doesn't have a body.

00:43:15.530 --> 00:43:17.670
Okay, so what does he think of the Democrats and Republicans?

00:43:17.670 --> 00:43:19.770
He doesn't think, he has no consciousness.

00:43:19.770 --> 00:43:22.114
He abandoned it in the wheel of life.

00:43:22.114 --> 00:43:23.974
So where is he?

00:43:23.974 --> 00:43:25.780
I don't know.

00:43:25.780 --> 00:43:27.490
You have to think about it.

00:43:27.490 --> 00:43:30.390
You keep saying you want to attain Nirvana,
what do you mean?

00:43:30.390 --> 00:43:32.890
I want to get rid of this body that will get cancer.

00:43:32.890 --> 00:43:35.373
No matter what you drink, you'll get cancer sooner or later.

00:43:36.910 --> 00:43:38.300
And I want to get rid of this consciousness.

00:43:38.300 --> 00:43:41.310
It's mixed with jealousy and other things. Okay, what

00:43:41.310 --> 00:43:44.380
happens after you get rid of it?

00:43:44.380 --> 00:43:47.131
Oh, I didn't think of that. [Laughter]

00:43:47.131 --> 00:43:50.040
[Cough] I wanted to get off the bus.

00:43:50.040 --> 00:43:52.570
And then you were standing in the middle of the desert. Did

00:43:52.570 --> 00:43:54.170
n't you say you wanted to get off the bus?

00:43:54.170 --> 00:43:57.823
Yes, but I didn't think about
what would be left after getting off the bus.

